{"page": 1110, "w": 1209, "h": 1868, "lines": [{"t": "1084", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.4484, "y": 0.0696, "w": 0.0471, "h": 0.0134}, {"t": "会议", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.2646, "y": 0.109, "w": 0.083, "h": 0.0248}, {"t": "MEETINGS", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.0761, "y": 0.1101, "w": 0.1975, "h": 0.0226}, {"t": "Before the meeting 会议前", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0736, "y": 0.1437, "w": 0.3461, "h": 0.0259}, {"t": "• call/convene the meeting, or invite", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0942, "y": 0.1874, "w": 0.3408, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "people to attend the meeting", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.2049, "w": 0.2623, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "召集会议或邀请人们出席会议", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.1233, "y": 0.2222, "w": 0.2578, "h": 0.0134}, {"t": "• draw up and circulate an agenda", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0964, "y": 0.2425, "w": 0.3139, "h": 0.0134}, {"t": "拟定并分发议程", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.2602, "w": 0.1413, "h": 0.0131}, {"t": "• Ifsome people are unable to attend，", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0964, "y": 0.2805, "w": 0.3543, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "you may need to postpone or call off/", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1188, "y": 0.298, "w": 0.3475, "h": 0.016}, {"t": "cancel the meeting. 如果有些人无法出", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.3137, "w": 0.3453, "h": 0.0177}, {"t": "席，可能需要将会议延期或取消。", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.1233, "y": 0.3314, "w": 0.287, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "At the meeting 会议中", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.074, "y": 0.3692, "w": 0.287, "h": 0.0233}, {"t": "You usually appoint somebody tO. 通常委任某人：", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0964, "y": 0.4111, "w": 0.4439, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "• chair the meeting 主持会议", "c": 0.3, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.4288, "w": 0.2735, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "•keep/take minutes 做会议记录", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.4462, "w": 0.3049, "h": 0.016}, {"t": "After the chair has opened the meeting, the first points/items on the agenda are often to", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0964, "y": 0.4679, "w": 0.7982, "h": 0.0147}, {"t": "主席宣布会议开始之后，头几项议程通常为：", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.0987, "y": 0.4839, "w": 0.3834, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "• approve the minutes of the previous meeting 通过上次会议的记录", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.5015, "w": 0.6166, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "• agree on the agenda for the current meeting 商定本次会议的议程", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1211, "y": 0.5187, "w": 0.6099, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "It may be necessary to 可能有必要：", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0942, "y": 0.5407, "w": 0.3184, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "• add an item to the agenda 增添一项议程", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1188, "y": 0.5581, "w": 0.3901, "h": 0.0147}, {"t": "• remove sth from/take sth off the agenda 将⋯从议程中删去", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.1188, "y": 0.5755, "w": 0.5583, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "In a meeting you can 在会议中可以：", "c": 0.3, "x": 0.0942, "y": 0.6221, "w": 0.3543, "h": 0.0161}, {"t": "consider（深入地/详细地）考虑", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0942, "y": 0.6497, "w": 0.296, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "an issue in depth/detail 问题", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.4238, "y": 0.6497, "w": 0.2668, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "a matter 问题", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.4215, "y": 0.6669, "w": 0.1302, "h": 0.015}, {"t": "discuss（深入地/详细地）讨论", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0942, "y": 0.667, "w": 0.2825, "h": 0.0147}, {"t": "examine（深入地/详细地）探讨", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0942, "y": 0.6846, "w": 0.296, "h": 0.0131}, {"t": "debate（长时间）辦论", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0942, "y": 0.7064, "w": 0.2018, "h": 0.0147}, {"t": "an issue at length 问题", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.4238, "y": 0.7077, "w": 0.2108, "h": 0.0147}, {"t": "discuss（长时间）讨论", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.0942, "y": 0.7238, "w": 0.204, "h": 0.0146}, {"t": "a problem 问题", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.4236, "y": 0.7463, "w": 0.1417, "h": 0.0176}, {"t": "address 处理", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0919, "y": 0.7471, "w": 0.1233, "h": 0.0131}, {"t": "identify 找出", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0919, "y": 0.7643, "w": 0.1234, "h": 0.0149}, {"t": "tackle 着手解决", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0919, "y": 0.7805, "w": 0.1457, "h": 0.0145}, {"t": "an in-depth discussion about/on the issue 深入讨论", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.4215, "y": 0.8023, "w": 0.4664, "h": 0.0162}, {"t": "have（对这一问题）进行", "c": 0.5, "x": 0.0919, "y": 0.8035, "w": 0.2242, "h": 0.0134}, {"t": "have（对这一问题）进行", "c": 1.0, "x": 0.0919, "y": 0.8255, "w": 0.222, "h": 0.0134}, {"t": "an in-depth look at the issue 深入研究", "c": 0.5,